      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#5→0 · Q27 political return; A30/C42; C57; A32; M02, M20, M24, M26, M40, M46, M48",
          "title": "Return without inheriting the hidden throne",
          "italic": "The whole demonstrates the exact consequence: release must reach the office of measure as well as its current occupant — a larger shared account gains no exemption from the question asked of the smaller one.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "Six leaves the Village with others — Butler, Forty-Eight and the former Two beside him, then diverging. The familiar face beneath One's masks and the automatic door in London alter the sense of arrival without making every escape fictitious. Q27's political return: a counter-position must be able to return the field rather than take possession of the office it opposed. A30/C42 define shared conditions administered without reciprocity.",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "C57 extends this to artifacts, permissions and inherited accounts; A32 demands the reply be able to revise the image, its measure and the institution holding it. Returns-to: M02 (subject vs assigned predicate), M20 (the cut's apparatus visible), M40 (the hidden evaluator), M46 (participants contest the counting), M48 (a federation answerable to sources). Rover, the embryo room, Fifty-Eight and the rocket receive no symbolic equation to a native determination (human-amplified: no).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
